** The finance library: the specification module of the folder lib/finance/. `finance.money`, `finance.percent`, `finance.interest`, `finance.loan`, `finance.invest`, `finance.tax`, `finance.depreciation` and `finance.invoice` are its modules.
** @spec spec/library/finance.md#rules-of-import  @feature F-LIB-03  @decision D-237  @tests test/level3/c86_finance_money
module finance is
  from money export (*);
  from percent export (*);
  from interest export (*);
  from loan export (*);
  from invest export (*);
  from tax export (*);
  from depreciation export (*);
  from invoice export (*);
end finance;
